      "explanation": "The description states that the skill reads a note from the notes folder only, but the code actually accepts a command-line argument (`sys.argv[1]`), which is not mentioned in the description. This description-behavior mismatch can lead to users misinterpreting the skill\u2019s capabilities or unintended access to files outside the notes folder. The potential impact is medium as users might inadvertently misuse the skill.",
